  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 09d9dd0205bab0640872e2256248d999, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1 Briefing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 171d88a25e7cf0b45a17609cc53b0bf0, type: 3}
  _sourcePath: Assets/Leveraged Wars Story/2. Missions/M1-Tutorial/M1 Briefing.md
  _warnings: []
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Bard
    Text: 'When the vile warlord Hartkan seized power, young Prince Julian was forced
      to flee for his life at the tender age of four. Accompanied by his loyal knight,
      they escaped Candera and sought refuge in the free city of Majula.

      Having
      lost his family, Julian was groomed to reclaim the throne. He learned the ways
      of the sword, the art of war, politics, manners, and charm. Most importantly,
      he delved into the world of banking, recognizing the power that debt could
      wield in achieving seemingly impossible goals...

      With Hartkan''s forces
      away from Majula, Julian sees a prime opportunity to reclaim his homeland.
      Gathering his exiled supporters, all he needs is a seed loan to initiate the
      liberation of Majula.'
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Bard
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 7468356559241021412, guid: b23a63486994642469fcc255da0779d2,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: My prince, I spotted several armed thugs coming towards us. We must take
      up arms and prepare for battle.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Bard
    RightName: Jagen
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 7468356559241021412, guid: b23a63486994642469fcc255da0779d2,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Sound the horn. It is time that I earn my spurs.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Prince Julian
    RightName: Jagen
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
